<title>USA: Workgroup CFO George McHorney departs.</title>
<headline>Workgroup CFO George McHorney departs.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workgroup Technology Corp on Monday said George McHorney departed as the company's chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Gerald Christopher would serve as acting chief financial officer until it found a permanent replacement.</p>
<p>Workgroup, which data-management and workflow systems for engineering and manufacturing environments, did give a reason for McHorney's departure.</p>
